  ('007a8484-d5b3-5066-b3d0-f9f1cefbb2e3', 'Cathryn Stiles', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116804227874190048802', 1.0, 'Not impressed and very disappointed. I ordered a pizza online, you don''t know what the wait time is until you pace the order......105 minutes. I ordered at 5:22 PM. At 7 PM I called them to check on my order and was told it was going to be another 15-20 minutes. I received a call at 7:32 PM letting me know my 1 pizza was ready for pick up. They had these stations set up where different orders were ready for pick up. I grabbed my box and headed out the door. When I got to the car, I noticed the box wasn''t even warm. I handed it to my husband, he opened it and touched it. He confirmed that it wasn''t warm. After waiting over 2 hours for a cold pizza, there was no way in HELL I was going to wait again! I''ll just make a note and not order from them again. Maybe pre-Covid they were worth the hype.', '2020-12-26 16:50:25'),
  ('243cbbd9-1c00-503f-b1d0-c08f3a58777c', 'Just another day in Alaska Ak49', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117465159445008762156', 5.0, 'Awesome pizza', '2020-12-25 09:04:00'),
