  ('e10423ab-74f7-5694-838c-c87d03c6fa90', 'Terri Linse', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109574055994292619076', 5.0, 'Amazing bread sticks as well as pizza. We had the Wild Mushroom & the Gyro. Both held their own in the FABULOUS category!', '2020-08-01 05:12:01'),
