  ('2fbc2079-63f2-52a8-b175-f99c765cf009', 'Conner Erickson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111328647508645544110', 5.0, 'Always great pizza. Very conscious of allergens and offer many gluten and dairy free items.  Great place!', '2020-07-30 17:47:45'),
