  ('06f0080d-440f-5da3-b3d9-832e27b4567e', 'Dale Moore', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112349158762277628913', 5.0, 'If you''re in Anchorage, you''ll definitely eat here. Be that as it may be. Get them out of the program. Pizza is fine. Creative finishing touches. Perhaps the best in Anchorage, but that''s not intended as sparkling praise.', '2020-07-29 01:50:18'),
  ('784a0998-55cc-55ba-bf45-3d9bec51b0dc', 'Gregory Hartley', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106615845338944867842', 4.0, 'If you''re in Anchorage, you''re probably going to eat here. So be it. Get it out of your system. It''s good pizza. Creative toppings. Maybe the best in Anchorage, but I don''t mean that as glowing praise. (Anchorage has a problem with too many pizza places and not enough good pizza.) But they''re also probably the busiest restaurant in Anchorage. Plan to wait. Avoid weekends. Call ahead. Even during a pandemic. They do get props for their handling of social distance for both dine-in and takeout. They''ve added a cool new outdoor dining room to help.', '2020-07-24 08:11:05'),
