  ('93afd3fc-0790-5318-94dc-18ee9b9994fd', 'Brian Lervold', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109821270316786075277', 5.0, 'I''ve lived in Alaska a long time and have always heard good things, but never went. We ate at 2pm on a Thursday and there was a 30 minute wait to be seated. Our server was amazing and the homemade root beer she suggested was great. I had a Cuban, and the sandwich was fantastic.i finished everything off with one of their home made beers Triple Lindy, I think it was called...at any rate, I regret not going sooner.', '2020-07-21 04:31:52'),
