  ('59c1c697-3f17-5907-9807-6436c453241a', 'Alison Kelley', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112650729976596751803', 3.0, 'I''m a NJ native and particular about pizza. The pies are ok, but the marinara is pretty blah and a lot of the other pies are too over the top for my taste. I prefer their salads. I''m an IPA fan, and the Fairweather is reliable. There are usually a few rotating taps so you can try something new. And, they sell a 2-oz sampler, which is perfect if you want a beer but have to drive. People love this place, so it''s almost guaranteed to please your guests, so I come here for them. They do get an A+ for COVID practices - they''ve put a lot of thought and effort into keeping everyone safe.', '2020-07-11 06:41:17'),
