  ('c30e3cac-a68f-5665-a583-3c666b042f9e', 'Daniel Brown', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115195051181181424657', 5.0, 'Fantastic pizza and great local beers. The service here was great, although they were really busy the day we came. Family of four we had three pizzas and it was very reasonably priced and we ate off of them for days! Definitely going back when in Anchorage again!', '2020-07-06 09:49:45'),
  ('d729efa8-5060-5e21-b842-f3f1f154ce57', 'Executive Thrillseeker', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107024672811788833969', 5.0, 'Waited 35 minutes during slow tome caused by covid. Every minute was totally worth it to be honest.  We went with a half/half buffalo chicken and fire house...absolutely amazing incredible!  The beers here that are brewed by the same company will steal your heart as well.  Service on point as was the coordination of getting in and out and dining in and taking out!  100/100', '2020-07-06 04:38:54'),
