  ('7a5a2660-a3e5-5c57-b85c-8f16e92f69b0', 'Tyrone Bass', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116068382779616524174', 5.0, 'I just finished eating a half and half white pizza / meat lover''s pizza at the moose tooth pub and pizzeria on 33rd Avenue and old Seward highway in Anchorage. I see why moose tooth is ranked the best pizza joint in Anchorage and the 2nd best pizzeria in America because the pizza was delicious. Also the mozzarella sticks were fantastic. If you ever visit Anchorage and decide to have a slice of pizza go to the moose tooth at 3300 old Seward highway. I give the food and the staff a five star.', '2020-06-29 03:42:02'),
