  ('0283ca70-8b20-5336-8bc5-1ab8c68850b5', 'Ruth Dinardi', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101749102947330809231', 5.0, 'Waiting 20 to 25 mins. Ok waiting for the amount of people. Plus they are having closed tables due to covid safety procedures.

All employees wearing PPE
Restrooms super clean and employees come every now and then to disinfect.

At table you will have a electronic menu so you can scan and see it on your phone. Pretty nice.

Appetizers quick and delicious.
Pizza big, good amount and very tasty. Speed is good as well. Dough super salty and fluffy.

Over all this place is awesome and inexpensive. Well due to the amount of food provided.
Prices do start from $10.00 and up to $40.00', '2020-06-20 18:12:58'),
