  ('7aba7656-b905-590d-b2db-010394d2300b', 'Mason McCloskey', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105660641377461347121', 5.0, 'If you come to Anchorage and don’t stop by Moose’s Tooth, did you really come to town?? The pizza is phenomenal and the servers are always fun and friendly. Definitely a go to spot for pizza and more!', '2020-06-15 17:40:38'),
