  ('37b2b017-665e-5f40-955e-6259e7496ccf', 'Brian Bowen', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105712054758690480207', 5.0, 'Good pizza and service.  The large was a good size large. With plenty of toppings.', '2019-12-30 00:40:25'),
  ('0d3fa9c4-e80f-5729-a6e4-088843343968', 'Daniel Calugan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100147621435273119482', 5.0, 'This place is really a staple in Anchorage, pizza is great and you can find something to please anyone in the family, my favorite is Santas little helper or the steak chipotle pizza, for chicken the spicy chicken picante is darn delicious.

They also have a variety of beers they brew in Alaska, Raspberry wheat is something a lot of people like, my favorite is the Hard apple ale or their Hefenwisen.

But be warned, it is a popular place so expect to wait a bit but it is worth.', '2019-12-29 23:24:54'),
  ('9552b650-9804-5de4-89c4-9b3c186e38e6', 'Ellie Joy P.', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108628795114743688426', 5.0, '', '2019-12-29 04:46:03'),
