  ('4f8857f6-6996-5e82-8b63-6c76808f6b7f', 'Tha Baer', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111868950892509965527', 5.0, 'Great pie!! Have had Lombardi/ Pizza Bianca,  but Capria in Tarrytown and Mouse Tooth are all running for first now. Top 3', '2019-12-28 04:32:46'),
  ('77044bbc-b5ff-544b-952f-1e1a79663d1e', 'George Constantino', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114314856081399563742', 5.0, 'Always a delight to celebrate a birthday at the Moose’s Tooth.  Their craft beers are excellent and they keep creating new pizzas to keep it interesting.   We mixed it up with a plain cheese pizza for the GKids, a small combo Thai & Roosevelt Chicken pizza for the ladies and a combo Nutcracker/Elf pizza for the guys.  Service was great and the atmosphere warm.', '2019-12-28 00:37:19'),
  ('3b2f268f-fb28-52b5-8fab-0d289ce47cc6', 'Don Olypopper', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115092377500947400659', 2.0, 'Decent pizza but too many earth muffins.', '2019-12-28 00:15:45'),
  ('40bf72f0-4f05-5633-ac30-7b85832d53ed', 'Matthew Bigman', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114225333977726431315', 5.0, 'Fantastic house made beers, best pizza in town, and warm fire pits while you wait. Lives up to it''s reputation, though arrive early as there is almost always a line.', '2019-12-27 16:29:15'),
