  ('3a7885f0-b8b7-59ba-9fb8-84aa02d8d7fc', 'Ryan Alverdes', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112569635659741013657', 4.0, 'The first time we ate here, we started out with some pretty rude service, but it got better and the food made up for the service.  That was peak tourist season, though, and they were probably just worn out from it.  Visiting in December, service was perfectly fine, and the food was still good.  Not the most amazing pizza I''ve ever had, but it is up there.', '2019-12-15 05:07:06'),
