  ('0042264b-71e5-56e6-83c7-d380574f38c5', 'David Jones', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101234793333780390952', 4.0, 'It truly is the best pizza we’ve had in Alaska.  The options are great and the food is certainly worth the price.  They down side is it’s a serious hassle to try and eat at their location.  It is always packed and usually it’s a 45 minute to an hour wait.  So instead of waiting with 3 kids, we just ordered takeout.  Don’t miss out on this place when in Anchorage, it’s worth the wait, I’m just not a very patient man.', '2019-09-06 19:44:24'),
