  ('23d3b15a-4a7b-5ade-be6d-250854222e60', 'Rebecka DeRoos', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102123538808974624996', 5.0, 'Yum. We had time to kill in Anchorage before catching our flight so we Googled restaurants with outdoor seating and ended up here. The place was packed but we didn’t have to wait long. The pizza was great, try the cheese bread with their house sauce, delicious. The beer was also really good, had a seasonal coconut brew that has had me wanting to go back to Alaska just to have another glass.', '2019-08-04 14:23:48'),
  ('aa5b27c8-a8ec-506c-9f9c-0ddeb488e16a', 'Barbara Frey', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115264581163216987573', 4.0, 'Good varieties of pizza and beer', '2019-08-04 07:35:26'),
