  ('07a5d993-ad49-5a1b-9400-25d12f0025fd', 'Ulysses Sfedj', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103304156937518647718', 4.0, 'The pizzas are decent. I usually go for the thai one with peanut sauce, the barbecue chicken one or the southwestern taco. Just yesterday I had the margarita on wheat crust with vegan cheese, and it was so good that half the pie was gone before I made it back home.
However, trying to eat on site is a trying experience, first because of the wait to be seated, second because of the crowding and resulting noise, making it less than intimate or relaxing, at least for me.', '2019-07-23 03:17:56'),
  ('1aa472e1-7d36-5bde-8698-07c045f9699c', 'Wendy Duncan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102205210094320747449', 5.0, 'Wow! Best pizza I''ve had in a long time! Great beer options. The MoosePie at the end of the meal was to die for! It was soooooo good! Enough for 5 people.', '2019-07-23 01:39:52'),
