  ('aadbea6b-364d-5fac-920e-cc9c65d5b200', 'Lesleigh Pendery', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114823449608883425976', 5.0, 'Lunch special is a slice and salad for $8. This place has a huge fan base, for good reason. The pizza is awesome.
I recommend all of the pizza, but especially the Brewhouse with Denali sauce ( spinach blended with ricotta cheese).
Word of warning, this place is very busy, all of the time. Expect at least a 20 to 25 min wait at most times.
They also have Bear Tooth, their brewery, with a ton of beers on tap, with seasonal rotations.', '2019-07-15 21:41:43'),
  ('f343611b-751d-54f0-9c56-bdf6bcef5f01', 'Ken Rowlan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108493575452743354370', 5.0, 'Wow! I think we overbought just looking at pictures but my soul is glad we did. This pizza is serious. I wouldn''t hesitate to recommend to anyone. Get some!', '2019-07-15 18:16:43'),
