  ('6368d7f9-0f66-5e16-8960-3eaaf0d7ffb1', 'Dana Schadek', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105306678604498640478', 5.0, 'Best pizza I have ever eaten!  When you read the menu, sometimes the ingredient combos sound strange, but I have yet to try a pizza I havent liked!  Go early and prepare to wait, as this place is always busy no matter the time or day, but it is always worth the wait.  Oh, and dont forget to try the delicious in-house brewed beer.  You wont be disappointed!!!', '2019-07-14 15:31:17'),
