  ('e28d6353-24e9-5831-b196-618f1026d9a2', 'm. w. brooke', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108139187649723050438', 5.0, 'this place is wildly popular! my partner and i stopped in on a monday night and the wait was over an hour, so we came back on tuesday afternoon and there was still a wait, but we were seated very quickly. the pizza is very good, with perfect crust (thin, with bubbles and a crisp exterior/chewy interior), and top notch ingredients. the salad we got was also very thoughtful in terms of flavor and portion. as someone from portland, i''m often confused by the struggle i''ve had to find good pizza in a town that prides itself in its foodie culture. i think moose''s tooth works because of its lack of pretension and commitment to good, simple ingredients, while still being innovative.', '2019-07-13 03:10:45'),
  ('0d9a63e3-f859-5f99-948a-90f3d8a1076c', 'Chief Reviews Everything', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116232211063796788294', 5.0, 'An Anchorage Must Have!!! Unique and delicious pizza combinations and great atmosphere, awesome portions!!!', '2019-07-13 02:43:03'),
  ('394312e3-f6eb-5139-b72a-b55e6bca1be5', 'Alexandria Barrera', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113768425901457491612', 3.0, 'I was told that this place was ranked the best pizza in the US. It’s not bad but not the best. I did order to go to take it with a grain of salt but when I went to pick it up the place was packed and the staff wasn’t particularly friendly when I walked up to the hostess desk.', '2019-07-12 01:44:16'),
  ('1ac2c38b-385f-5ead-9766-1eb04dd2960c', 'AK Bronco', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104632929380382083084', 5.0, 'Out of this world pizza. Service was fast you will wait for a table and dont forget a growler to go of their own brew of Apple Ale.', '2019-07-12 01:07:59'),
