  ('d64b14ba-f03b-5282-a26a-0afbdd7803c8', 'Eric Collier', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106632271512698934630', 5.0, 'Pizza and Beer are the main staple. You can bet it''s within the top five pizzas you have ever tasted. We showed up at 930pm and the place was packed. Took about 20 minutes to be seated. During the wait we enjoyed a sampler of thier beers. Once seated, service was fast and friendly. Pizza took about 15 minutes from order to plate. If you are visiting Anchorage, put this on your must list.', '2019-07-09 16:50:33'),
  ('f97d2544-3135-5c62-88bd-18b38b8fc702', 'Jason Kieffer', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106767039649649016772', 5.0, 'Great pizza!', '2019-07-09 04:02:31'),
