  ('957983b3-7fc4-5f6b-ba43-b8ff1002d902', 'Jenna Campbell', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106095053538023206032', 5.0, 'Super busy, so we picked up our food. The food was great and I loved all the pizza selections. The diablo bread was sooo good! Would definitely go back and try more of their pizzas.', '2019-07-07 17:10:16'),
  ('45ea18c4-fe1e-5013-aee3-46db5501456a', 'Robin Lozano-Adams', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110900207001505409449', 4.0, 'Great pizza, has to be hands down the best I''ve ever had! 2 years ago came to Anchorage ate the pizza there and this time visiting I just had to come back! I joked and said, " I came to Alaska for 2 reasons,  Halibut Fishing in Homer and Moose''s Tooth Pizza!" Great job guys! Although your pizza is fabulous, your hostess station girls and the people who sell your T-Shirts were a bit rude! We bought 2 t-shirts and were going to buy more but the lady helping us was so rude and acted as though we annoyed her that we didn''t buy but the 2.', '2019-07-07 15:20:11'),
  ('836ca109-60f7-59bb-9d00-c1cebe515e65', 'Joshua Stephenson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114339007811506411488', 5.0, 'The server was so full of information and insight into the area and with beer, and was very personable. The food was amazing and wait time ended up being much quicker than expected. What a great, accomplished pizza place!', '2019-07-07 06:53:12'),
