  ('5b504143-bf38-5ca6-8819-d22fa173b4ef', 'Annie Bi', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105948946839788343856', 5.0, 'When we went at about 6PM, there were alot of people, and we had about a 25 minute wait. It was all worth it though! We had the mozzarella breadsticks, which was delicious and 3 pizzas. We have a family of four, and we got a small Call of the Wild (meat, veggies, and the garlic sauce was amazing!), and a large Napoleon (prosciutto, arugula, fresh tomatoes) and All-American (basically combo). It was worth the wait! We finished all but 3 slices! Definitely the best pizza place I''ve been to!', '2019-06-30 05:48:31'),
