  ('5af17833-a9f1-51b4-a34e-20a97fd38ec3', 'Rosie Callender', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103832222480380982049', 5.0, 'Went there twice during our 4 day vacation to Palmer and Anchorage.  Great beers and pizzas.  Highly recommend this place if you''re ever in Anchorage, Alaska.', '2019-06-08 21:50:37'),
  ('e9f282a1-2c41-56ac-9c34-1d510f0ab9fc', 'Belinda MacIntire', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105146350631705022763', 4.0, 'We went for lunch it was very busy there. Very slow but understandable. How ever what I didnt like was the people that ordered soup and Salid were servers way before people ordering pizza or other items when it was clearly there lunch choice so the table did not all eat together. Some were finished while others were just getting served. It was uncomfortable. Get a clue and serve the table together people go out to lunch together to eat together not watch each other.', '2019-06-08 14:35:08'),
  ('d6276d55-8662-5475-85dd-88f34db6c26c', 'Laurie Kahl', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107037699166305372068', 5.0, 'Fun place to meet with friends', '2019-06-08 13:07:15'),
  ('6fc3c899-c47f-5d4d-bb5b-1b8431ad1521', 'Malachy Moran', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101918008428837832486', 5.0, 'If you come to Alaska and don''t eat here you are doing it wrong. Sometimes there is a two hour wait, and it is still worth it. Get a beer and chill by the fire. Try the Diablo Breadsticks!', '2019-06-08 03:24:28'),
  ('8c5f9a98-0161-5324-b487-cab6d82706ab', 'Jack Elook', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115994259203436470712', 5.0, '', '2019-06-07 07:46:01'),
  ('c07deeb3-c433-5625-81de-54f57fd9547e', 'john bavendam', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114708451836203783385', 5.0, 'Love the food here Pizza is amazing salmon pate is awesome along with the Diablo breadsticks does take a bit to get in because it''s so popular you can bypass an order takeout which if you''re not there for the atmosphere or their craft brew beers it''s a nice option parking lot also can be a bit of a challenge as the popularity of this place exceeds itself highly recommend the Call of the Wild also the Santa''s Little Helper all of which were cooked to perfection', '2019-06-07 04:08:09'),
  ('777e3588-752e-5402-80bd-3693887179cc', 'Rick Kelly', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118110155584181546020', 5.0, 'There''s a reason it''s consistently rated the best pizza in Anchorage. Santa''s Little Helper is the bomb. Great draft choices too.', '2019-06-07 02:35:25'),
