  ('c92f0b2a-45d4-545c-a086-1eeab0ae2c83', 'Andrea Fergus', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107183428433283298519', 5.0, 'As usual, the food was excellent! I did an order to go, and I think from the time I called to the time I got the food, it took about 25 minutes. Even if you place the order over the phone, you can expect to wait a few minutes in line when you get there to pay. The place is super busy all of the time, but even with that, they do an incredible job of maintaining quality of the food and quality of service. I don''t mind waiting a couple of extra minutes, because for as busy as it is, it''s not that much extra time - and it is always worth it!', '2019-05-03 13:37:05'),
