  ('466e3982-246e-5c73-92ef-5b780030b160', 'Rob Petrie', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113676377856586522663', 2.0, 'Ordered the Classic, the All American and a Vegetable pizza, from Moose''s Tooth. While it may be a favorite pizza place for some, found the pizza over rated and over priced.  Hopefully, it was just an "off day" for the preparation, cooking of these pizzas, if what was given to me is their best, all I''ll say is, Anchorage you need a REAL pizza place, and not a place melting cheese on dough.', '2019-03-10 03:13:15'),
