  ('5530a069-1b45-5b10-be07-a4e736d125bd', 'Wilson Cullor', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111405336471910856526', 5.0, 'The mouse''s tooth has carved out an indelible place in the Anchorage food scene. While it isn''t exactly traditional, it certainly is eclectic and unique. This is one of the must visit pizza restaurants is Anchorage!', '2019-03-01 03:58:38'),
