  ('cedd95e4-fd53-52ec-b9b9-5cdbaeffe1b3', 'Nikhil Ket', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107343839789560016992', 5.0, 'I order the Diablo Breadsticks every time I am here and they are the best. The service is prompt and the servers are friendly. There might a long wait time depending on the day of the week or during evening time as this is a very popular place. They have a good selection of beer as well for the beer enthusiats.', '2019-02-19 07:02:12'),
  ('7905aadb-4b47-50dd-9dfc-dbe22cf2e3a1', 'Cole Anderson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109957038095121422521', 5.0, 'Worlds best pizza! And amazing craft beer', '2019-02-19 06:26:37'),
  ('f598accf-dd90-553c-8a2b-889e565ed2b5', 'Amber Cruzado', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103544397630748617544', 5.0, '', '2019-02-19 02:46:21'),
  ('65b4c550-4779-5937-b64a-f489b07402a5', 'Brian Watts', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113448529872060846405', 5.0, 'All I can say is I love it!', '2019-02-18 22:26:27'),
  ('e140c2f8-db54-5a81-ad79-e1dc29098757', 'Shane Mecham', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113920727864982256434', 5.0, 'There it''s usually a wait,  but it''s worth it.   Great pizza,  hot sandwiches and salads.  Desserts are great as well.   Can''t really say anything bad about the place except for parking and the wait.   Parking is really just due to size and volume of customers, but have patience and be sure to use the space appropriately.

Atmosphere is always active,  ranges from young to old.
A couple suggestions,  diablo bread sticks, spicy shrimp pizza,  Santa''s little helper,  the white, buffalo chicken salad.   For something different,  Cubano sandwich is awesome. Great selection of drinks, including local and their own brews.  Have an adventure, everything is good, so don''t be afraid of something different.  Btw, apricot  chicken is really good.', '2019-02-18 15:39:58'),
  ('aab6bacf-b2c8-5962-88b4-f65a05f30eed', 'Stephanie Poirier', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112526659478768999660', 5.0, 'No other place like Moose''s Tooth. Once you go moose...', '2019-02-18 06:14:24'),
  ('9ae1191d-4160-5cae-8c92-0d6e0b72de56', 'Melissa Thompson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111916020125535614518', 5.0, 'Best pizza in town 😁', '2019-02-17 18:57:04'),
