  ('3dec5c0a-0252-5792-934b-d8a7533a7fb0', 'Jeff Brasel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104669774648588549462', 5.0, 'Great pizza! Try the hot turkey sandwich if you''re not into marinara...delicious. can be busy but well worth a visit!', '2019-02-09 00:39:05'),
