  ('8d95efd8-f092-53e7-a805-b4abe6563c5d', 'Andrew Schritter', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115432522843315306002', 5.0, 'My wife and I have been eating here for the past four years and it''s consistently the best pizza place we have been to in Anchorage. They make specialty pizzas and beer. I recommend this place to anyone who wants the best 🍕 and 🍺.', '2019-02-05 01:56:42'),
  ('63d8a9b0-5783-524a-8c6b-479261a1a72f', 'Yolanda Thomas', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117104424806566496044', 4.0, 'Best place ever', '2019-02-04 20:24:40'),
  ('79b32c29-e946-5f34-814b-9d55d9281e8f', 'Mandi Ward', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112735383169841241167', 5.0, 'Best restaurant in town. I was so pleased that after 13yrs of being away from Alaska the food is just as delicious as it was before. If not better. I love the garlic pizza with a light beer.', '2019-02-04 16:16:01'),
  ('ddac93a3-ab36-5915-aa74-ff6b33e595f6', 'kalyn montague', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107073504398694370218', 2.0, '', '2019-02-04 13:16:57'),
  ('adb5f727-f384-540a-a2ec-13c5805d602f', 'Brian', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100108220591188643236', 5.0, 'Best pizza northern hemisphere home-brewed root beer and cream soda by the jug love it', '2019-02-02 21:55:45'),
  ('5688c77c-92dd-5fe3-8460-47f651952b91', 'Tim Morin', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102962974143542429906', 5.0, '', '2019-02-02 09:05:33'),
  ('b09c00ce-7346-5c71-9129-bf541277c646', 'Alexander', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101946133236161205877', 5.0, 'Amazing pizza from what people were saying was "America''s 3rd Best Pizza Place." I don''t say it''s the best but still very tasty. This place was highly recommended by nearly every local we came across. The reindeer pizza was delicious. I got some Denali sauce on the side for an extra $1.50 but was surprised it was served cold. Good food and dessert, will come back when I''m in town again.', '2019-02-02 04:07:17'),
  ('69fe1480-761f-577f-9fca-48b022f39fa3', 'sam reynnells', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109719315263241240067', 5.0, '', '2019-02-02 01:47:25'),
  ('6ce791b9-fcf2-5ec9-8cb6-8557e029f587', 'Troy Mclaughlin', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105987491203696110637', 5.0, 'Awesome pizza and great beer selection to be had. A must stop....reasonable prices for what you get.', '2019-02-01 22:01:22'),
  ('3f296885-0335-5dbd-9a70-3f8da6a57f3a', 'Adrian Francis', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111368401855318862230', 5.0, '', '2019-02-01 21:10:28'),
  ('a16f22c3-323d-51c4-a4b0-364142ebde59', 'Craig Aitchison', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116557266011274748021', 5.0, 'Soooooo good!', '2019-02-01 03:11:04'),
  ('b79fe69f-0482-5b07-852a-82746a454f38', 'Donald Gerhart', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112069292448809325566', 5.0, 'The parking lot and nearby street may be filled to over-flowing with vehicles, yet they still manage to make room. Without a doubt the best non-franchised pizza and wing spot in town.', '2019-01-29 23:25:44'),
  ('17cfaad0-78fa-5e1d-8c02-8a426b7f75d6', 'Jason Davis', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117259111307366569984', 5.0, '', '2019-01-29 04:22:04'),
  ('08c1c723-888d-593e-bc67-1d117dc4764e', 'Martin Jetté', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110337039971885484060', 5.0, 'Amazing breadsticks and amazing pizza. Gray ambiance !', '2019-01-28 03:58:05'),
