  ('1c49411e-b415-596d-8324-bfa4653fe546', 'The Roaming Rosiers', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103642289631120420181', 4.0, 'Have been a couple of times since intial review below the mozzarella bread is good, ceaser dressing unique with a slight kick, fam likes the Aloha and I like the backpacker with Canadian Bacon added.
Our past couple of servers have been wonderful.

More hype than anything and the drinks are pretty good. It is crowded, expensive, and you can get pretty much get better pizza anywhere else in Anchorage. Get take away if you want to try it and you can have a beer while you wait.', '2018-12-30 03:19:08'),
