  ('dc545bd0-d8d3-5500-97a3-3e961cbd872b', 'Paul Robarge', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117621543989633667017', 5.0, 'I love this place but i am so sad they dont make my favorite beer anymore. Midtown brown was my favorite and the best beer i have ever drank. At one time the waiter told me i drank more of that beer than anyone and then they took it off the menu  at least give me the recipe. Oh yeah the pizza is great also. Every trip to Anchorage should include a stop here.', '2018-12-26 08:42:52'),
