  ('048c4e75-cdf8-5455-ba73-f2d9b8786154', 'Joshua Curtis', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107760758252500452521', 5.0, 'Amazing pizza choices and original beer options. My favorite spot!!!', '2018-12-24 18:37:45'),
  ('75bb3f4b-f679-539a-a9ae-531a00edcb06', 'Kenneth Scherer', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104222579559594880449', 5.0, 'Best pizza I have ever had. Many unique toppings for the pizza. My favorite pizzas are the avalanche, Santa''s little helper, and the Thai chicken. Also be sure to order the Korean sweet and spicy wings. It is always busy, usually a 45-60 minute wait, but well worth it. While you wait you can grab a drink at the bar and have some of their house brewed beer, such as the raspberry wheat.', '2018-12-24 14:36:47'),
