  ('9cb4f536-660a-5406-a8ac-3b809a5fddc2', 'sylvester sanchez', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108970514621946615447', 3.0, 'Quality and consistanty of their signature items, ie. salmon dip, and pizza, was top notch for awhile but has dropped over the years. What was once a perfectly cooked pizza is now often burned unevenly on the crust or salmon dip is way to cold. But when you are serving a mass amount of people this becomes difficult. I''m afraid this once great restraunt is unable to keep up with it''s own popularity. The staff is still very friendly, and do their best to serve you. Although this once was one of my favorite places, we now pass on it, to head somewhere else local.', '2018-11-26 02:01:37'),
