  ('209eebb3-02f1-5c26-8c2c-46ae6499366e', 'M E', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111123002324047505776', 5.0, 'Silis was our waiter, he was OUT####INGSTANDING!!! He recommended our pizza, which was half garlic lovers half call of thg he wild. It was one of the best pizzas I''ve ever had. He brought us samples of different beers based on our liking. He told us of a local band that has come up. He gave us some recommendations of things to do around town. Really, he made our visit special.

Even when we arrived the bar was very efficient and getting us a drink. We will be frequenting this place. Could not have been better. Way above expectations.

Thank you Silis and Moose Tooth!!!', '2018-10-28 18:04:04'),
  ('58aa571c-900b-5ef8-b1ad-bb92777816ea', 'CHERYL Bowlin', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115113436825228947705', 4.0, 'Possibly best pizza to date. Who knew macaroni cheese on pizza could taste so good', '2018-10-28 17:03:52'),
  ('da61c59a-4d72-55fc-93bb-ecd8bc534101', 'David Maddison', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109124500510284889906', 4.0, 'Controversial- but this was not the best pizza I’ve ever had 😅 sure it might be the best in Anchorage and the base is perfectly cooked but I felt the topping let it down - need some more punch and we tried two different types. Don’t get my wrong, it’s still good, I just wouldn’t be willing to trade my first born for it like some of the five star reviewers of this venue seem compelled to do.', '2018-10-27 23:09:11'),
