  ('2039da6f-cb7c-570b-ad21-dd53eadb71f6', 'Kali Pepper', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117027289979268146208', 5.0, 'Love this place. They have amazing topping combinations and an excellent (housemade!) beer menu. I’d like to rate it a 4.5 because it’s a taddd overpriced and because their crust isn’t the best. Regardless, their pizzas are so creative. You’ve never had pizza like Moose’s Tooth and it’s a must go restaurant to anyone visiting Anchorage. It’s always packed but the atmosphere is great and you will not be disappointed.', '2018-10-24 13:14:17'),
