  ('3b5c3796-4e3e-5092-943c-ee05ca13891c', 'Dom C', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101351749534695350985', 5.0, 'I can''t put my finger on it, but this is some of the tastiest pizza I''ve had in my life. There is a wide selection of beer and wine as well from local breweries as well as national brands.', '2018-10-13 22:17:54'),
  ('53e44609-a175-5675-9e49-42637e217717', 'Josiah Rock', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102749682852038117932', 3.0, 'Decent pizza, but it''s always packed, honestly don''t see the worth in going besides for the tourist attraction', '2018-10-13 18:28:46'),
