  ('27c883bc-4e52-510c-9349-7c56f7dc4f9f', 'Dakota Rhine', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104954544778120259822', 5.0, 'The food here is incredible! My favorites are the Forager pizza and Diablo breadsticks. On the Forager, you can really taste the truffle oil and it blends nicely with the fresh veggies. The Diablo breadsticks are probably the most unhealthy thing on the menu but the sauce is to die for!

No matter what time you go, expect to wait 30 minutes at minimum for a table. Generally, if you want to eat during a normal time you''ll wait for more than an hour. However, you can walk to the bar and get some craft beer so it''s not a bad deal if you are patient.', '2018-08-12 03:35:54'),
  ('bf476823-46ff-520a-9cf5-448f54a811cf', 'Thomas Larabee', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106412017704962727134', 5.0, 'There''s a reason why they''ve got a reason for some of the best food in Anchorage. Excellent Pizzas with exotic ingredients, and great salads. I''m definitely a repeat customer. 👍', '2018-08-11 05:17:38'),
  ('b1239c56-4982-5b10-961a-c27a056c05ae', 'Jaime Chanter', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101837223785195075280', 5.0, 'Unique combinations of flavors!  Awesome selection of drinks, salads, and desserts!  Always crowded but the staff moves you through quickly but doesn’t make you feel rushed. Awesome spot!', '2018-08-11 02:45:04'),
