  ('6c06dc43-25ef-5fe5-b808-f9d24f093a94', 'Bruno Couto', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104508546658301114333', 5.0, 'Very tasty pizza. My wife is originally from Jersey and holds a pretty high standard for pizza. Moose’s Tooth has great pizza and brews. We live 2.5 hours away and often bring some back home with us whenever we’re in Anchorage. This place is always packed, so plan on calling ahead or waiting a bit, especially during dinner time - worth the wait!', '2018-08-07 18:27:46'),
  ('f098734b-ca98-5ec7-aaf8-b109b925fc5f', 'Marc Willson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108382000374537703080', 5.0, 'Good Pizza', '2018-08-07 02:32:47'),
  ('d82db9e2-c164-5a35-b75f-850bc274b8e6', 'David Bozard', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108951910325130691559', 5.0, 'I’ve traveled quite extensively and had many different types of pizza. NOTHING beats Moose’s Tooth. There is always a long wait (up to 1.5 hours) but it’s always worth it, especially while you’re enjoying their great beers from the bar. I always love their revolving unique  specialty pizzas. If you like spicy, I also recommend the Diablo Sticks!', '2018-08-07 00:11:13'),
  ('bab90ab6-5d0d-5dc8-8d71-497952805c0b', 'Alice Marin', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108709618781482223000', 5.0, 'Good pizza and bread sticks umm', '2018-08-06 19:47:06'),
  ('96b5fe2a-392e-5f8b-a3ef-fddcbf75ba3d', 'Bonnie Wall', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103405594419285119518', 5.0, 'Excellent food and fun, hip, bustling atmostphere. Pizza was in my top 5 of any in the U.S.   Lots of brews to choose. Always busy and usually has a wait, but it is worth the wait. Carry-out available. It was so fun we had to get t-shirts. They offered many cool designs. The whole family enjoyed the experience.', '2018-08-06 13:50:19'),
  ('8699695e-c0f9-5cef-9e49-28b07ac6b063', 'Jeff Hamilton', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102655042815173335616', 3.0, 'I was so disappointed.  I heard this place was amazing, so I was willing to wait over an hour for a table on a Monday evening.  I ordered a thai chicken pizza and it was almost flavorless.  I didn''t taste any thai peanut sauce on it at all.  The beer was good, however.  I wouldn''t go back there again; I''m sure there other pizzas may be really good, but I don''t want to wait over an hour to find out.', '2018-08-06 03:08:32'),
