  ('7db85184-8c8c-53cb-8524-ea8c8cb58155', 'Robert Bernard', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101576238642732615767', 5.0, 'Great place to eat and drink. And call lyft. Don''t drink and drive .', '2018-07-16 07:15:18'),
  ('34908d13-d4d2-5550-8510-cae370e6c4f6', 'weldmonkey', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117980262782697378344', 5.0, '', '2018-07-16 06:23:58'),
  ('fcf3ed4e-5f81-5c30-925d-3cd3b69485e0', 'Pudu Creative', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111110119940403907052', 1.0, 'Over-hyped and crowded with "sheeple" who have poor taste in pizza. There''s always a long wait during which you are expected to overflow outside and stand around at the entrance with hordes of forlorn and hangry-looking customers. This last time, we were given an estimate of 1 hour and 15 minutes wait time... LOL bye!

From past experience, the pizza is not even worth a 15 minute wait. The pizza here is consistently bland and dry with barely any toppings. The only reason we considered it today was because we happened to be in the area and decided to give it one more chance after a year without bothering with this restaurant. I have no desire to ever come back.

I felt inspired to write this review to help spread the word about what a huge waste of time and effort it is to attempt to eat here. There are several other establishments in Anchorage that serve excellent food and treat customers to a great experience at every opportunity. Moose''s Tooth is NOT among them. PASS this place up.', '2018-07-16 03:08:37'),
  ('f324e791-8f89-502a-834a-3323f38a35fc', 'Monica Garrison', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108972928360228285491', 5.0, '', '2018-07-16 02:25:54'),
