  ('52abe5c3-58c3-55e2-878c-c954d31fde28', 'SQWHIRLY', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112457866695080949805', 5.0, 'The variety and creative array of pizza pies make this pizza joint worth the time spent. It is addicting and always brings you back in knowing there will always be something new to try out. Not just that but always yummy and never a disappointment with your new taste adventures', '2018-07-04 13:52:52'),
  ('e5ea0962-7782-533b-8c61-ffbe8ce77a30', 'Jorge Portell', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112012616537066249947', 5.0, 'It could be the best pizzeria in town, but I still got a few more to visit. For now you get the top spot. It''s the locals favorite, always full including the parking lot when high season comes around and good beer. It''s alright, but it''s more like a locals hangout spot, also you can refill your beer Jugs before going home. It is more about the name, but definitely a place to check out.', '2018-07-04 08:49:07'),
