  ('3e846e7a-8b85-578f-ae38-4335577548b4', 'Charlie Kim', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101557646647055405878', 5.0, 'If you''re able to, get it to go because this place is packed! Very much recommended, though. The pizza was very good, and the salads we got with it were fresh. I get the hype!', '2018-07-02 12:33:31'),
