  ('a48ec451-81af-5035-b461-7a2d634b8a71', 'Heather Brown', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102070015202328152119', 5.0, 'First time to moose''s tooth!! Fantastic food!! Fantastic!! Would definitely return. The restaurant has a welcoming feel. The staff was friendly and courteous and answered all my annoying questions. The food was fast and fresh. Price wasn''t bad. Good to finally have gone and can''t believe I missed out all these years.', '2018-06-29 02:59:54'),
  ('1d830280-115a-5899-914b-87e907bece56', 'Chris Breck', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112745621514633000278', 5.0, 'Great pizza and beers! Always a fun atmosphere!', '2018-06-28 22:12:00'),
