  ('7d6a87c4-837e-5abc-9e6f-8473ec8fea0f', 'Ethan Link', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116230254940856882959', 3.0, 'First thing to know is this place will have a line out the door and a long wait, with no reservations. I''m pretty patient but not when the waiting area is packed and there''s nowhere to sit for an hour.  If you''re committed to this place and you drive, go around the side and order for carryout; they will have you ready to go in 30 min, and even sell 6-packs or growlers of beer for $9.50. Not bad and no wait.

The main thing MT has going for it is the huge variety of toppings, meats, real vegetarian options. If that excites you go for it.  The pizza crust is underwhelming, especially if you are used to good pizza.  For the price and wait, you could be disappointed, but no one promised you top-five pizza in Alaska.', '2018-06-25 05:46:02'),
  ('b9b473a3-ae1b-555d-ad93-b3e1081ae883', 'Tracey Jones', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117101730327837805772', 5.0, 'Great food, huge portions! Lovely atmosphere and very popular so maybe book a table or be prepared to wait. Staff very friendly and helpful', '2018-06-25 02:57:33'),
