  ('778fbfca-bb85-5138-b3d5-d059150f0104', 'William Calhoun', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118437678085693724364', 4.0, 'This was a fairly good experience. The beers we ordered during our 30-minute Friday lunch wait were awesome. Darth Delirium and Midtown Brown. Yummy. We had a Greek salad (not good at all) and two lunch special consisting of Caesar salad (good), Buffalo salad (really good), a White slice (really good), and a Cheese slice (good). The beers made everything better, the restrooms were clean, and service was good. Reminds me of a TGI Friday with more class.', '2018-06-16 19:21:15'),
  ('ef574eed-1568-5d53-a47f-f880caa1d454', 'Scott Marshall', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103633511280857012098', 5.0, '', '2018-06-16 04:27:51'),
  ('8172baac-f0c7-58db-a39f-7ccbc49f4f48', 'Bill M', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115890663056283735428', 5.0, 'Great choice coming here for dinner.

I took one bite of the "Santas little helper" pizza. I felt a rush of histamines flood my system. I looked to my left, out the window, and where my reflection should have been, I saw George Washington nodding at me. I then looked back at the masterpiece of pizza I held in my hand and cried a single tear of Jack Daniels.

To those considering coming here. This IS the greatest pizza place in the United States. It''s even poetic. Americas last frontier, the end of the road for any American travel. It''s only fit that the reward is the most euphoric pizza experience one can embark on.', '2018-06-16 03:01:46'),
