  ('89449491-50f9-5340-9bd6-9c367b068a51', 'David Burman', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115643638919200391622', 5.0, 'Best pizza that I know of. I would’ve loved to be at the party where they designed the menu. I picture bunch of hippies sitting around smoking salads, drinking beer and having a grand time coming up with different types of pizzas. They did an outstanding job. You can tell that they use quality ingredients. Their crust  is spot on. The service is laid back yet quick. I have always seen a bit of a wait when I go there but have always felt that it is worth it. My favorite pie… Santas Little Helper.  Try their house made soda!', '2018-06-04 07:09:10'),
