  ('3c8c415e-ff9b-5808-9968-c1a6b3c6278e', 'Jonathan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113902723872931416245', 5.0, 'Been there at least THREE TIMES in the past 10 days because they are so good.  Salads are delicious (recommend the buffalo chicken salad as it is home made buffalo style and not just a ton of Frank''s dumped on it), the pizza is EPIC, and the beer selection is spot on.
The location can get busy at times, however, the kitchen must be well staffed as food came out quickly, hot, and fresh.  The reviews are true as this place is amazing and I want to try ALL the pizzas!', '2018-06-01 17:04:42'),
