  ('3332d1bd-bb8d-5222-8da6-456a70f290af', 'Y A', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112339175203130249581', 5.0, 'So the pizza and service was great.  But I had an issue when it came time to pay, last night on 4/16/18.  A buddy from the military had been in town for a few hours on an extended layover and we went to grab pizza and beer (2 beers each... Bill totaled for those at 11.50). He paid for the food I paid the drinks.  Well I dropped a 50 and initially got only 8.45 back.  The waitress acknowledged this and gave me back another 25... Still off.  I tried telling her it was off by 5.05 from I should have gotten... But my buddy mentioned to her it was just a nickle and off she went.  Im not too upset over it.  Im more upset that since the meal had been split into 2 checks why I didnt get a receipt with the cash purchase.

All I got was the original receipt saying what I owed.  My fault, apparently, so oh well.  Still... Excellent food.', '2018-04-17 18:08:01'),
  ('104f40ee-84c5-50a6-8a7d-0fb0c588d529', 'dylan dreyer', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113383954167277749333', 5.0, '', '2018-04-17 02:28:03'),
  ('a675dcd8-bb85-52b4-9ce2-66790eec507e', 'The Database', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116320740120902886860', 5.0, 'The people are amazing, and so is the food. Wait is usually a bit long, but always worth it.', '2018-04-16 23:43:03'),
  ('7e8be262-ebca-58ec-8ba3-b0411251d246', 'Brandon Waipa', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107782903682994260529', 5.0, '', '2018-04-15 23:06:34'),
  ('32be4bee-8a89-5b28-ac25-5179c9609d34', 'Cindy O''Neal', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109009898519847035147', 3.0, '', '2018-04-15 16:23:53')
