  ('b8f02cc0-2b74-5b33-860d-0555926bea5b', 'Wayne Paliwoda', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114524207733220602816', 4.0, 'My first meal after I moved to anchorage and they did not disappoint. The beer and pizza selection is diverse. It would be surprising to hear someone say they didn’t find anything on the menu that sparked their interest. 4 stars only because the waiter set my girlfriends beer flight down in the wrong order.', '2018-04-08 00:29:06'),
