  ('e0e33f82-1ade-55fc-a831-09b363197208', 'Ron Knueppel', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104918129547990737128', 5.0, 'Pizza was fantastic as usual!', '2018-03-19 23:48:11'),
  ('658954fe-fde1-567f-9781-f271c6207601', 'Mike McCully', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103453518016577821962', 4.0, 'Pretty good pizza. There''s a lot to choose from and they will do half pizzas (one half this the other half that). I got half gyro half chicken picante. The gyro meat was ok but the tzatziki was gloppy. The real speciality here is the beer. Its really good and there''s lots of choices. Service and the dining room are nice enough. Its the kind of place that runs the local 80s radio station in the background and people sing along. All those good songs: Ratt and Aha and Billy Joel. Really. Make it a stop. Its worth it.', '2018-03-19 23:09:59'),
  ('396ca3f6-ebea-5ccb-9857-9de3d82bd503', 'Erin Atwood', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118138628752100283484', 5.0, '', '2018-03-19 16:40:29'),
  ('576e151a-e9fc-5a59-aab9-5b1a65057615', 'A B', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107527827688949737879', 2.0, '', '2018-03-19 04:48:52'),
