  ('8e6471c6-7333-52c2-9bd3-991a8013f100', 'Mikhail Bakhrakh', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101697139618420604392', 5.0, 'Great pizza- very huge and tasty. Beer is nice too as any homebrewed beer...update: the best pizza i''ve ever eat across world 🌍
