  ('f49ab27f-a891-589c-88a7-058d0bef253a', 'Vivian Cooper', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104135015975164982413', 5.0, 'The beer.... YES!
The pizza... YES!
The service...YES!
There is not a lot that I can find negative about this pizza joint, excerpt that I couldn''t eat all of the pizza!  I was able to take it with me, though!  I really enjoyed the pizza here and to think it has taken me three visits to Anchorage before finding this place.  Now I am sad.', '2018-02-25 20:56:35'),
  ('aa242650-81bf-55ba-8e57-024199c525f0', 'Sonia Revolorio', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106494216242964581982', 5.0, 'Great pizza, all-around!!!
