  ('c08cb868-0e7b-5274-acc0-475524381a94', 'Troy Remy', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103678734706958443548', 5.0, 'Amazing pizza, beer, and everything else. Expect a long wait here... it is worth it. Do not hesitate to walk up to the bar and grab a glass of beer from their HUGE selection of micro brews while you wait.

You really cannot go wrong with any pizza. If you cannot decide, they will do a half and half with anything on the menu (including different sauces). Too many great pizzas to recommend a favorite. Order several and take the leftovers home!

Staff is always super friendly and the atmosphere is super cool. Any time of day, a 30+ minute wait is normal. Be prepared for that.

They do sell their dough. So feel free to make your own creation on your own time.', '2018-01-29 04:51:35'),
  ('7580ab29-56fa-5034-b0c1-418ab4261531', 'Gary Drew', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108398918961640721923', 5.0, 'Best pizza and beer in town.', '2018-01-28 16:29:33'),
