  ('b7027f40-4ba7-5622-83f5-756f86c8d034', 'John T', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102543788698991828551', 5.0, 'Best pizza in Alaska and some of the best pizza we have eaten from pizza places all around the world. The wait time though is very long, sometimes more than 2 hours. But that is a reflection of how good the pizza is. I recommend a call in order if you do not want to wait or have small children. Moose’s tooth is a local favorite. Great selection of Craft Beers too.', '2018-01-26 10:47:45'),
  ('785f4b5e-81ab-533c-a232-712c4d9bd527', 'Jennifer Austin', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105705000815390271663', 5.0, 'Truly Alaskan! The pizza, salads, wings and beers are awesome. Great service too! Our family loves Moose''s Tooth!', '2018-01-26 08:45:32'),
