  ('b3779ad6-6d31-5f5b-ac88-27ba9764d18d', 'Murph Murphey', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101725263859253210550', 4.0, 'Pizza, salads, and fresh brewed beer. Enjoyable atmosphere. They are a bar but they have a much more brewhouse feel. No TVs. Came in on a football playoff Sunday.. would have been nice to catch the score, but that''s obviously not what this restaurant is trying to promote. Not a good or bad thing just know that going in. Been a couple times didn''t love my salad dressing the other day, but hey they can''t all be homeruns.', '2018-01-25 22:07:25'),
