  ('ff3e469d-561f-5b26-b014-733212f8ceaa', 'Andrew Frank', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100033692833453486209', 5.0, 'If you''re in Anchorage and you love pizza and local beers you must make Moose''s Tooth a destination on your itinerary. The wait times for a seat can be awful but there is a reason for that. It usually doesn''t take long to get your food once seated. You can order drinks at the bar while you wait (they have a spot just for you!) and you can enjoy a cozy outdoor waiting area if you enjoy the company of others (and a fire in the winter!). The pizza selection is top notch and the prices are affordable even for my family of five. It can get a bit crowded and some of the seating can be cramped but the food is amazing and the staff is very attentive.', '2018-01-20 06:47:20'),
