  ('89114c57-efd7-5d0e-ac49-a893a8474b53', 'Elizabeth Angasan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117653443537659801063', 5.0, 'Moore''s Tooth is a must have experience here in Anchorage. The atmosphere is chaotic and busy, but the quirky art & the amazing food (including their famous topping loaded pizzas) are worth the wait!!', '2017-12-28 10:11:21'),
  ('ae275d28-ae9e-51d2-9f51-cc8c15f8db34', 'Jeff Manes', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102942467858850991897', 4.0, '', '2017-12-24 21:13:58'),
  ('b845f345-c7d7-5358-a9e5-8f362b5c7098', 'Lydia Johnson', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104605667026735360098', 5.0, 'Truthfully the best pizza in the country. If you don''t like the more adventurous toppings they have traditional options but why would you want to when the other choices are so good! My favorites are the brewhouse favorite with chorizo and the solstice special with denali sauce instead of marinara. Also, the diablo breadsticks.', '2017-12-23 23:44:57'),
  ('c3f74a67-79ea-5761-9a54-c14e8d4d6e4c', 'milo eakins', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101657048168751136384', 5.0, 'the place is packed, I can easily see a wait here. the pizza is excellent, I picked the wrong ones. the spicy Thai first is not spicy but still tastes good. then i got the nutcracker special with apricot sauce, bacon, ham, walnut and cranberries. it tastes really good. just be adventurous. will for sure come back and try more traditional pizzas.', '2017-12-23 23:39:13'),
  ('52df8d59-9b77-5229-a42e-e648da1f27be', 'Paul Y', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111287423681770016459', 3.0, 'Good pizza.  Not so good service.', '2017-12-23 09:47:30'),
