  ('242497e9-b6af-5382-9533-c92835484edd', 'Nolan Oliver', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107513683795501617523', 5.0, 'Best pizza in the nation! I''ve had dishes that I haven''t liked from here, but only because it wasn''t a flavor combination I appreciated. It''s never because the food is poor quality or bad. Light pizza crust, quality toppings, and wonderful combinations available on the menu for you to pick from if you don''t have a favorite you always go for.

Try the diablo sticks with sauce.', '2017-12-22 23:00:12'),
