  ('6279f360-2e7a-50fb-aaeb-9624f3e04b50', 'Kaitlyn Norris', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110039766245671100805', 5.0, 'Food was good and so was the service. However visit was at 1030am on a Monday.', '2017-12-11 20:58:08'),
