  ('e1f2e0d9-feb9-5740-b928-d2914ed50509', 'Nicole Deren', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109413562532452850656', 5.0, 'Love this place as much as every other Alaskan. Fantastic pizza, service, and beer. Not only are the pizzas delicious but so is everything else on the menu. I''m obsessed with the Hungarian Mushroom Soup-I always pair it with a different salad. The Thai Chicken Pizza is my favorite but Avalanche is also a classic. Always get a growler of the IPA after your meal. Summer concerts are a blast.', '2017-12-09 08:56:12'),
  ('98f67bda-2e11-55ba-8f56-6894377bb2bd', 'Matthew Dodge', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112799583155065657764', 1.0, 'Moose''s tooth has semi okay pizza, but there management treats there staff like s**t and is extremely rude to the servers and bartenders. Unfortunately I will no longer be eating here due to the way the treat there employees, and remember, anytime you have the slightest complaint about anything, the server is immediately put on 90 day probation or fired even if it''s out of there hands.', '2017-12-09 08:19:29'),
  ('cfab1bc4-29ea-5ae9-8d90-26988f74fd6b', 'River Knowles', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103438462840442507152', 2.0, 'Expensive and a long LONG wait. No food is worth that long of a wait.', '2017-12-08 07:56:04'),
  ('d9bf307c-2aa5-544d-a3b0-95c31bc0eb97', 'Devin O''Driscoll', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107735513908430401640', 5.0, '', '2017-12-06 21:20:41'),
  ('44f53acd-a90d-5523-8279-2c011da9eb63', 'Lesdork', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104305581938038350374', 5.0, '', '2017-12-06 04:54:23'),
  ('09e1516c-d992-5781-82ff-c338cae7d4d1', 'Amanda Schultheis', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101637134022227250840', 5.0, 'Best pizza and best craft beers. Get the Diablo sticks!', '2017-12-05 05:32:14'),
  ('a2f9247d-861b-5046-9696-c3526a48e82a', 'Oscar M.', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113087560260326158159', 4.0, '', '2017-12-05 05:01:37'),
