  ('001b0dee-2201-57d8-8de3-18a225a2d290', 'Elsy Danedi', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112042124178392590913', 4.0, 'I always set aside about three hours if I go here because they are busy on every day of the week so you''re going to have to wait and easy 45 minutes to be seated (most likely in your car during the winter because their waiting areas are right next to the door and/or outside). Otherwise, pizza is definitely better than the majority of the pizza joints in town, and prices are reasonable.', '2017-11-27 21:43:43'),
  ('80f187e2-a0f6-56c6-a543-c60244611a8a', 'Bob Chan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116578142256672745924', 3.0, 'So I went to Moose’s tooth on a Friday night, so the parking situation was quite tricky. The parking lot is quite spacious however there was just so many people. The wait was about 30 minutes long. I loved the food and the environment however the server took quite a while to get to us. I inquired about the flight of beer and he told me that at I could choose any beer on the menu and it would cost $5.5 but when I received my bill it was over 10 dollars. When I wanted to ask about it, he was so busy and could never come to me. However I would like to say that the food is A+ and delicious! And the atmosphere is perfect', '2017-11-27 03:42:58'),
  ('7454f463-a9e3-52f8-b3d1-7dde1fb7fe18', 'Ben', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109466440126078276556', 4.0, 'Nice atmosphere, friendly proffesional service. Great pizza, the root beer and cream soda are excellent as well.', '2017-11-27 03:21:57'),
  ('5b807a77-0287-5f3d-8776-0a1b4abb3bdc', 'Mike Baxted', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106529750998484564507', 5.0, 'Best pizza West of the Rocky Mountains', '2017-11-27 01:54:36'),
  ('291a5bc3-9945-565a-8cd4-3b2496f6cb6d', 'Jace Toney', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102577179223367384471', 5.0, 'Attention to detail is key. Pizza is crispy. Toppings are great. Crust is perfect. Keep it up!', '2017-11-23 23:16:05'),
  ('c240309b-c7a5-506a-86ee-6a9e8fb830ec', 'Anna Layton', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109012539916092298277', 5.0, '', '2017-11-23 17:24:09'),
