  ('96b8af03-3560-56e3-aa56-802f47dea158', 'Caleb', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106132929714253091646', 5.0, 'So much great food.  You can''t go wrong with any salads, apps, pizzas, or dessert.  Stop by for a slice and a salad at lunch, bring a squad by for the works, or grab a feast to take home.  Pretty expensive and quite the long wait, but super worth it.  I recommend attempting to go at off times like 3 pm... but still expect a wait.  Make sure to try the death by peanut butter pie!  Beer selection is awesome as well, there''s something for everyone.', '2017-11-14 01:46:20'),
  ('d9be0301-43ab-5cf6-bde3-45f3aac698d9', 'Jason Singh', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112579098078232561151', 5.0, '', '2017-11-13 06:07:24'),
  ('9d269b70-67de-5fbc-999d-1fb18467782e', 'Susan Lamb', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101773146998471673915', 5.0, 'Never had a bad pizza. I love this place!', '2017-11-13 04:19:32'),
  ('a30d54a2-6d33-58bb-a047-c951719a5967', 'chris alford', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106213113158394814133', 5.0, '', '2017-11-13 03:40:25'),
  ('afe9a596-b58d-516e-9e0c-2e0a5e03466b', 'megan gonio', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107608305523953114508', 5.0, '', '2017-11-13 03:25:49'),
  ('c6fb918f-c995-54a2-b37d-55858c5ce6ff', 'David Heim', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114255546692066558468', 5.0, 'Great Pizza cold beer', '2017-11-13 01:35:47'),
  ('94299c61-9c97-54f1-a4ed-8987dbf8ae88', 'Anne Dixon', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108008880891160145664', 2.0, 'Decent pizza but not worth the wait and hype. We''ve come here 4 times, and the first three times we turned around because of the 45 minute wait and college house party level of crowdedness. We finally stuck it out, and it was very anticlimactic. The menu other than the pizza and a couple appetizers is pretty standard food you could get anywhere. Sure, the pizza was good... But not worth 45 minutes of waiting, being scolded by a staff member for waiting in the wrong spot (there''s a waiting room that the hostesses didn''t tell us about), and waiting 10 minutes in line at the bar, where they only serve beer and wine (and I was looking for a non-alcoholic drink, but they only have root beer, cream soda, sugary "teas," and NA beer. There are other pizza places in town with good pizza and none of these other annoyances.', '2017-11-10 19:11:19'),
  ('1b844262-5891-522d-baee-807300f6c6f4', 'Luke Hollinger', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109123430457116659256', 5.0, 'Best pizza. Great beer.
Always busy, but in the good way! Staff are wonderful, and families are welcome!
My favorite pizzeria, and I visit any chance I get.', '2017-11-10 03:36:32'),
