  ('6b7f02bb-c8a9-573b-b714-aa2430759eb6', 'Dimitri Smith', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100333447409817212188', 5.0, 'There''s usually a pretty decent wait to be seated here, but it''s for good reason...this place is absolutely delicious! The pizza is great, they brew their own beer, and the atmosphere/employees are very nice. Try the Diablo Breadsticks!!', '2017-09-05 04:30:12'),
