  ('358ced1d-3660-53c0-b07f-16009e70c8a7', 'Mike Phutthong', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110489686673379404222', 5.0, 'Large parking lot but it will be hard to find parking space because this place is always crowded. Large craft beer and pizza selections. They also have handful of pizza selections for vegetarians. Excellent service. I''ve tried a lot of their pizzas and haven''t had one that isn''t good yet. One of the best rated pizzerias nationwide.', '2017-08-26 21:56:49'),
