  ('ff011531-4dac-5185-8f5d-de0873b0db4e', 'Timothy Adams', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116980021245557283414', 4.0, 'This place is rated the best pizzeria in Alaska, for good reason, the food is excellent! The only reason I didn''t give it 5 stars as because it''s super crowded all the time, and it''s very loud with people talking and talking and talking. They don''t take reservations its first come first serve. If you''re there on a weekend you can expect easily a 30 to 50 minute wait.   All the pizzas are very good and they have many different crusts to choose from and sauces to choose from. The side dishes and appetizers are also great, they have a growler bar with many different revolving Taps of beer that they make in their own Brewery. They have a takeout register apart from the regular restaurant which is convenient and they are always busy. You could also buy Moose''s tooth souvenirs here.', '2017-08-25 02:16:53'),
  ('d7cdfa36-5bfb-5937-9988-8e9c225f9fe3', 'Nathan Elliott', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111820241714113962993', 5.0, 'Long wait times for a good reason.... The pizza and beer are amazing.  Go when you are not in a hurry and have a great meal.', '2017-08-25 00:48:19'),
