  ('6719df9e-e381-5c88-ae17-1accf63e47d9', 'Cami Pena', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102221171188120956346', 5.0, 'The staff is friendly, they estimated the wait for 3 being about 20 minutes around 4pm on a Wednesday and it was just enough time to go to the bathroom, grab a beer and look at the menu. Fantastic pizza, I have yet to be disappointed and I really enjoy the atmosphere.
The beer is great too and I like how the staff tries to help you pick new choices in drinks. An Anchorage must for me', '2017-08-08 20:21:14'),
