  ('aca3a010-491f-5a6d-8ccb-a508d4c7fafa', 'Meghan Williams', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112225647040388085088', 4.0, 'Legendary pizza, but even on the weekday the wait is ridiculous for a table. I don''t go here much anymore because a meal will take 2 hours minimum, between waiting for a table and then your food. Just too popular now.', '2017-06-23 04:18:54'),
  ('a5e85578-c79a-5356-bf0d-dc1d4350adc4', 'Shannon Roohr', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117829150569625213067', 5.0, 'Menu is superb and atmosphere is family friendly', '2017-06-22 06:53:25'),
  ('23fc96ab-99cd-53c5-bad1-b70ba97dbf65', 'Sarah', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114567646533648213781', 4.0, 'Excellent pizza and beer selection... some say the best in Anchorage. Staff are friendly too. I would give 5 stars for this restaurant if they made it easier for large groups to make reservations in advance. Working in a military unit, we have many going aways and baby showers, etc, and we can''t reserve seating for these events. First come, first serve basis. Sometimes we will go elsewhere just to ensure we can have enough seating for everyone depending on the event.  Although I respect and understand this business decision, it''s odd given the fact we are a local organization... I feel there could be a better relationship there.', '2017-06-21 14:49:41'),
  ('2cd56855-afb0-5e55-ae13-d8541d3d7181', 'Kelly Forster', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106214056128932677922', 5.0, '', '2017-06-20 15:05:53'),
