  ('be91c388-4995-571d-9306-707001754034', 'Linda Darling', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103456395805104765631', 5.0, 'I have been hearing about this place for years. Finally  got Alaska. On the list of things  to do. I walked in the wonderful smell of homemade pizza made this upstate NY girl happy.  Large variety  of Pizza styles and topping. Great craft  beers.Service was prompt. Everything  was delicious.', '2017-06-14 16:38:00'),
