  ('61c5e2ad-1160-5787-b8fd-073e3a93c2b4', 'Michael Buck', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112063803104411842298', 5.0, 'Moose''s Tooth is THE spot for pizza and brews in Anchorage. It is always crowded though so if you''re in a hurry, call ahead for pick up. Pizza is very delicious. The Backpacker (vegetarian pizza) and Santa''s Little Helper are my favorites. Pair these up with any of Moose''s Tooth ipa''s and you are good to go. In short, great pizza and beer, decent prices, but always crowded.', '2017-04-17 00:41:29'),
  ('d28b41a8-ae82-57a8-a201-5f3fbab47454', 'Eme C', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117034845684412046466', 5.0, 'First time visiting Anchorage and we loved it! The service and ambiance are wonderful. The pizza I had was "the backpacker", a veggie one with thin crust. I''ve never had so much pizza! It was delicious!', '2017-04-16 17:50:53'),
  ('52e724cd-869c-540e-a821-86b76220e807', 'Brett Woofter', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106702240228676008611', 5.0, 'Ain''t heard about it yet, better learn about it', '2017-04-11 16:52:05'),
  ('55134e86-4ede-537c-a0d6-71d2e8928e0f', 'Rachel Moore', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107649814769261727565', 5.0, 'Best pizza in alaska', '2017-04-10 09:51:31'),
  ('c735f634-f2ae-5e71-bdc5-8ac0ec8d8243', 'John J', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117122776629947350268', 5.0, 'Great food, excellent staff, amazing beers. Enough said...', '2017-04-10 04:53:09'),
