  ('cd30b1d9-af28-5e30-b181-8a6b43f56352', 'Britni Smith', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108917502325717771010', 4.0, 'we''ve had some good experiences here, pizza is always good, tried the avalanche for the first time it was very tasty.', '2017-03-27 05:08:06'),
