  ('fabc3e40-2083-5ff9-843c-6ecff007c728', 'Mr. Fixit', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101107670041405020368', 5.0, 'I always enjoy visiting here for their homemade root beer and unique pizzas.  Mango and Carrot we asked?  It was good.  The atmosphere is perfect and very active.  This place is often busy even during office hours.  If after 4 pm call for a reservation.  Pricing is not cheap but worth it.

Overall impression:  Can''t wait to go back!', '2017-03-18 03:35:27'),
