  ('fa52f09c-697c-57e1-a0f3-04505c3a1c11', 'Cary Strahan', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105094470032329431653', 5.0, 'This is the place to go for pizza and beer!! They have a great selection of taps and pies galore.', '2017-03-08 15:59:06'),
  ('7d5a13b9-8bc4-5b8c-8455-1379ccf3ffff', 'Cydney Fenton', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103136280925850758531', 4.0, 'Service is good.  Pizza flavors are unique and flavorful.  Only reason not a 5 is that we had to sit next to the door and every time it opened, the negative 5 degree weather came in.', '2017-03-08 02:39:35'),
  ('20b305d9-a83b-567c-a8de-bfcd0cf43778', 'Andrew Scott', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112581441924627178908', 2.0, 'The chicken taco pizza ordered had bacon on parts of it, when the pizza description doesn''t list it as an ingredient.', '2017-03-06 22:18:01'),
  ('e782bf2e-a35e-555c-a9d7-2985a1ea76b5', 'Travis Sizemore', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115111394579078014575', 5.0, 'Named after the iconic Moose''s Tooth mountain to the north, this place is a must-visit for anyone coming to Anchorage. The pizza is very tasty and comes in many favors, both classic and unconventional (try the Thai pizza, but ask for Sriracha with it). Many beers on tap, local and otherwise. They have some pretty rad apparel (see pics). Be prepared for fairly long-wait times during the dinner rush, but the bar happily serves all waiting parties. Last, they have a classic Alaskan ambiance with lots of dark wood furniture and walls, and tons of cool Alaskan history and art.', '2017-03-06 21:57:17'),
  ('0d45956e-8519-5d0e-92a7-1138511b8413', 'Amanda West', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105089246792979410737', 5.0, 'Very family friendly. probably the nicest place we have eaten in awhile. Exceptionally friendly service even the cook was smiling and friendly. Great menu with lots of unique Alaskan good including caribu burger, reindeer  hot dogs, amazing chilli, and delicious jambalaya. The sweet potatoe fries were delicious with the homemade honey mustard sauce. We went with a family of 6 and everyone loved the food they ordered. We had little kids with us and the employees were very friendly with the kids. They had coloring books and crayons to occupy the munchkins. I highly recommend this restaurant both for the amazing food and the friendly service.', '2017-03-03 00:29:27'),
  ('3c07e394-93ee-5d96-8a74-21da2a4e0324', 'Ashley Plante', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103827236675772586982', 5.0, 'Amazing food, always busy. We order to go and pick it up.', '2017-02-28 20:03:31'),
