  ('b4fb97f8-07a3-5af6-98eb-d1c760230246', 'Chelsea Cassell', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111130607486220004130', 5.0, 'Top-rated pizza for the creative combinations.  I''m a huge fan of the shrimp fiesta pizza and the diablo bread sticks.  Only catch is there is often a hefty wait.  Try to go on off-dinner hours or the call ahead take-out is always a good option.', '2017-02-23 22:14:08'),
