  ('e1d859e1-3107-59a0-a50d-bb8b0393151a', 'Rahilah Taylor', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101431486283081838631', 5.0, 'Great beer and pizza! Mosses tooth offered a variety of gormet pizzas from vegetarian to meat lover selections. The smoked salmon spread appetizer is very popular and a must try! It''s served with bread, red onions and capers. Its very flavourful and spicy. This spot is typist very crowded with a wait time of a minimal 15 minutes. If you have a large party call ahead or be sure at least half of the attendees show up before trying to get on the wait list. The service here is always good, the staff is also very friendly! It''s a must go location in Anchorage!', '2017-02-19 10:34:22'),
