  ('18948775-2745-535b-a2ff-0330a1bdb9a8', 'Devan Thayer Lund', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101544375962129955816', 5.0, 'One of the best pizza places I''ve ever visited in my life. I''ve gone through about 1/3 of the whole menu at this point, and none of the food items have disappointed me. Variety is key, from the types of pizzas to the sauce and crust varieties, to their constantly-rotating list of house-brewed beers on tap. You can visit here for a couple of years and not have the same experience twice (although I have already developed a couple of favorites). I would recommend getting there sometime before the dinner rush, as lines can form out the door all the way to the parking lot (especially on the weekends).', '2017-01-09 01:30:14'),
