  ('773f0519-3cee-5d84-b41e-350fcf85ff45', 'Brian Slater', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116222799889325713684', 5.0, 'Moose''s Tooth Pizza is probably the best Pizza in town.  Just about all of them are good, but my favorites are the Chicken Bacon Ranch and the Greek Gyro.  It''s nice getting it half and half with each for a tasty combo.  It''s also nice if you''re ordering for a large group if you ask them to double cut the slices.  I highly recommend their Pizza.  Don''t forget to check out Bear Tooth too, if you want to watch a movie while eating this delicious pizza.', '2016-10-09 05:27:32'),
