  ('90bc8710-7e30-5ed5-a5f4-9a707a35ac1d', 'Kristine Kennedy', 'https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110485381248396376839', 5.0, 'Love the vibe here - consistently good energy and quality food, very frequently busy. Top rated joint yet unpretentious. Love it, regularly recommend. Wealth of beer choices, menu selections are creative and well rounded - if you like spicy, give the diablo sauce a whirl, comes with breadsticks but you can order on the side with any', '2016-09-17 05:03:21'),
